1
00:00:06,485 --> 00:00:08,445
(Sheldon(on phone):)This is Dr. Sheldon Cooper.

2
00:00:08,612 --> 00:00:11,242
(Sheldon(on phone):)Yeah, I need to cancel my membership
to the planetarium.

3
00:00:11,407 --> 00:00:13,407
[LAUGHING NOISELESSLY]

4
00:00:13,993 --> 00:00:15,533
(Sheldon(on phone):)Yeah, well, I'm sorry too...

5
00:00:15,703 --> 00:00:18,703
(Sheldon(on phone):)...but there's just no room
for you in my wallet.

6
00:00:20,541 --> 00:00:24,211
No, I understand, but it was between
you and the Museum of Natural History...

7
00:00:24,378 --> 00:00:26,758
(Sheldon(on phone):)...and frankly, you don't have dinosaurs.

8
00:00:28,424 --> 00:00:30,884
Oh, I'll miss you too. Bye-bye.

9
00:00:31,885 --> 00:00:35,475
(Sheldon(on phone):)Okay, I know you're texting about me
and I'd really like you to stop.

10
00:00:35,639 --> 00:00:36,679
[KNOCK ON DOOR]

11
00:00:37,725 --> 00:00:41,065
(Raj(entering):)Oh, dear, I am rightly and truly screwed.

12
00:00:41,228 --> 00:00:43,058
(Leonard:)I thought you were finding new friends.

13
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:45,060
(Raj:)I've got some feelers out.

14
00:00:45,566 --> 00:00:47,566
(Raj:)In the meantime, listen to this.

15
00:00:47,735 --> 00:00:50,065
[ON RECORDING]
Hi, Rajesh, this is Lalita Gupta.

16
00:00:50,237 --> 00:00:53,327
(Lalita(voice from Raj's phone):)Your mother gave my mother
your phone number to give to me.

17
00:00:53,490 --> 00:00:57,910
So I'm calling you and call me back.

18
00:00:58,078 --> 00:00:59,578
(Raj:)Bye.

19
00:01:00,205 --> 00:01:04,025
(Raj:)Can you believe how pushy she is?

